<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Arden Realty rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Arden Realty rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Bros analyst Steve Hash said in a research note that he had initiated coverage of Arden Realty Group Inc with a buy rating and a 12-month price target of $26-$27 per share.</p>
<p>-- Arden completed its initial public offering on October 3 at $20 per share.</p>
<p>-- The shares were unchanged at 22-1/4.</p>
</text>
